        <h2 class="section">3. Compliance of Laws Relating to Remittances</h2>
        <p>3.1 The VENDEE/S, if residents outside India, shall be solely responsible for complying with the
        Foreign Exchange Management Act, 1999, Reserve Bank of India Act, 1934 and the rules thereunder.</p>
        <p>3.2 The DEVELOPER accepts no responsibility in regard to matters specified in Para 3.1. The
